<title>USA: Harman International Industries sells notes.</title>
<headline>Harman International Industries sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Harman International Industries Inc was priced Wednesday via lead manager Chase Securities Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Harman is a leading global designer, manufacturer, and marketer of high-end, high-quality, audio products for the consumer, professional, and original equipment manufacturer (OEM) markets.</p>
<p>BORROWER HARMAN INTERNATIONAL INDUSTRIES INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.32 PCT   MATURITY 7/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.32 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 87 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
